---
// filepath: src/components/Navbar.astro
---
<nav id="nav">
  <a href="#top" class="brand" id="brandBtn">AMARGO<span class="brand-dot">.</span></a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#manifesto" data-text="Manifiesto">Manifiesto</a></li>
    <li><a href="#capabilities" data-text="Servicios">Servicios</a></li>
    <li><a href="#performance" data-text="Rendimiento">Rendimiento</a></li>
    <li><a href="#showcase" data-text="Trabajo">Trabajo</a></li>
    <li><a href="#testimonials" data-text="Clientes">Clientes</a></li>
    <li><a href="#faq" data-text="FAQ">FAQ</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contact" data-text="Contacto">Contacto</a></li>
    <li><a href="#instagram" data-text="Instagram">Instagram</a></li>
  </ul>
  <div class="nav-right">
    <div class="status"><span>5 CUPOS • AGOSTO</span></div>
    <a 
      href="https://wa.me/59898300491?text=Hola%20Amargo%20Creativo,%20quiero%20cotizar%20un%20proyecto" 
      target="_blank" 
      rel="noopener noreferrer" 
      class="nav-cta" 
      data-cursor="WHATSAPP"
      aria-label="Hablar por WhatsApp con Amargo Creativo"
    >
      HABLEMOS ↗
    </a>
    <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn" aria-label="Abrir menú" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="menuOverlay">
      <span>MENÚ</span>
      <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M2 2h8M2 6h8M2 10h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg>
    </button>
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="menu-overlay" id="menuOverlay" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="menu-grid">
    <ul class="menu-items">
      <li><a href="#manifesto">01. <em>Manifiesto</em></a></li>
      <li><a href="#capabilities">02. Servicios</a></li>
      <li><a href="#performance">03. <em>Rendimiento</em></a></li>
      <li><a href="#showcase">04. Trabajo</a></li>
      <li><a href="#testimonials">05. <em>Clientes</em></a></li>
      <li><a href="#faq">06. FAQ</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact">07. <em>Contacto</em></a></li>
      <li><a href="#instagram">08. <em>Instagram</em></a></li>
    </ul>
    <div class="menu-aside">
      <h4>ESTUDIO</h4>
      <p>Construimos activos digitales que hacen crecer tu negocio. No hacemos folletos, hacemos motores de ventas.</p>
      <h4>UBICACIÓN & DISPONIBILIDAD</h4>
      <p>Atlántida, Canelones<br>Cobertura en todo Uruguay<br><strong class="highlight-cupos">5 cupos disponibles este mes</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<button class="menu-close-btn" id="menuCloseBtn" aria-label="Cerrar menú">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
</button>

<style>
  nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    padding: 0 var(--gut);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    background: rgba(232, 230, 224, 0.9);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    height: calc(60px + env(safe-area-inset-top));
    padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top);
    font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease), background 0.4s var(--ease);
    will-change: transform;
  }
  :global(body.theme-dark) nav {
    background: rgba(20, 20, 19, 0.92);
  }
  :global(body.theme-electric) nav {
    background: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.9);
  }
  :global(body.theme-mate) nav {
    background: rgba(18, 30, 21, 0.92);
  }
  nav:global(.hide-nav) {
    transform: translateY(-100%);
  }
  nav .brand {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 20px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .brand-dot {
    color: var(--mate);
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  :global(body.theme-dark) .brand-dot,
  :global(body.theme-electric) .brand-dot,
  :global(body.theme-mate) .brand-dot {
    color: var(--electric);
  }
  nav .brand:hover {
    color: var(--rust);
  }
  nav .brand:active {
    transform: scale(0.95);
  }
  nav .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    list-style: none;
    height: 100%;
  }
  nav .nav-links li {
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  nav .nav-links a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  nav .nav-links a:hover {
    color: var(--rust);
  }
  nav .nav-right {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    height: 100%;
    margin-right: calc(var(--gut) * -1);
  }
  nav .status {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--bone);
    height: 100%;
    padding: 0 16px;
    font-size: 11px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  nav .status::before {
    content: '';
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--electric);
    animation: pulse 2s infinite;
  }
  .nav-cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: var(--electric);
    color: #0a0a0a;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    transition: transform 0.2s var(--ease), background 0.2s, color 0.2s;
    height: 36px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .nav-cta:hover {
    background: var(--bone);
    color: var(--ink);
    transform: translate(-1px, -1px);
  }
  .nav-cta:active {
    transform: scale(0.96);
  }
  .menu-btn {
    background: none;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    padding: 8px 12px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    height: 36px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    nav .nav-links {
      display: none;
    }
    .menu-btn {
      display: flex;
    }
    nav .status {
      display: none;
    }
    nav .nav-right {
      margin-right: 0;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .nav-cta {
      padding: 6px 12px;
      font-size: 10px;
    }
  }
  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { opacity: 0.4; }
  }
  .menu-overlay {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 150;
    background: var(--overlay-bg);
    color: var(--overlay-text);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: calc(80px + env(safe-area-inset-top)) var(--gut) calc(40px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
    transform: translateY(-100%);
    transition: transform 0.8s var(--ease-emphasis);
    overflow-y: auto;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    visibility: hidden;
    width: 100%;
    will-change: transform;
  }
  .menu-overlay:global(.active) {
    transform: translateY(0);
    visibility: visible;
  }
  .menu-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    flex: 1;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 32px;
  }
  .menu-items {
    list-style: none;
  }
  .menu-items li {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .menu-items a {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 6.5vw, 72px);
    color: var(--overlay-text);
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: 1;
    transition: color 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
    display: inline-block;
    word-break: break-word;
    transform: translateY(100%);
    opacity: 0;
  }
  .menu-overlay:global(.active) .menu-items a {
    transform: translateY(0);
    opacity: 1;
  }
  .menu-overlay:global(.active) .menu-items li:nth-child(1) a { transition-delay: 0.06s; }
  .menu-overlay:global(.active) .menu-items li:nth-child(2) a { transition-delay: 0.12s; }
  .menu-overlay:global(.active) .menu-items li:nth-child(3) a { transition-delay: 0.18s; }
  .menu-overlay:global(.active) .menu-items li:nth-child(4) a { transition-delay: 0.24s; }
  .menu-overlay:global(.active) .menu-items li:nth-child(5) a { transition-delay: 0.30s; }
  .menu-overlay:global(.active) .menu-items li:nth-child(6) a { transition-delay: 0.36s; }
  .menu-overlay:global(.active) .menu-items li:nth-child(7) a { transition-delay: 0.42s; }
  .menu-overlay:global(.active) .menu-items li:nth-child(8) a { transition-delay: 0.48s; }
  .menu-items a em {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    text-transform: lowercase;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--electric);
  }
  .menu-items a:active {
    color: var(--electric);
    transform: scale(0.98);
  }
  .menu-aside {
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    padding-left: 24px;
  }
  :global(body.theme-electric) .menu-aside {
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(241, 255, 90, 0.2);
  }
  :global(body.theme-mate) .menu-aside {
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(151, 188, 98, 0.2);
  }
  .menu-aside h4 {
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: rgba(244, 241, 234, 0.65);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  :global(body.theme-electric) .menu-aside h4 {
    color: rgba(241, 255, 90, 0.7);
  }
  .menu-aside p {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--overlay-text);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }
  .highlight-cupos {
    color: var(--electric);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .menu-close-btn {
    position: fixed;
    top: env(safe-area-inset-top);
    right: 0;
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    background: var(--electric);
    color: #0a0a0a;
    border: none;
    z-index: 200;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s var(--ease);
  }
  .menu-close-btn:global(.active) {
    opacity: 1;
    pointer-events: auto;
  }
  .menu-close-btn:hover {
    transform: rotate(90deg) scale(1.05);
  }
  .menu-close-btn:active {
    transform: scale(0.95);
  }
  .menu-close-btn svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .menu-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
    .menu-aside {
      border-left: none;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      padding-left: 0;
      padding-top: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
